   stage header renders underneath it (overlap, worst on mobile). Pin it
   back in-flow so the column layout reserves its space everywhere. */
.transactions-modal .tx-content-carousel .tx-3d-hero-shell {
  position: relative !important;
  top: auto !important;
  left: auto !important;
  right: auto !important;
  bottom: auto !important;
  margin: 0 auto 20px !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
